"Bot ratings start at 1000 and come from games against Sibyl and the bots on your own phone: normal chess with a clock, ending in checkmate or a draw, at least six moves each, and played without Undo, without hints and without Teach mode. Under 3 minutes counts as Bullet, under 10 as Blitz, longer as Rapid. The game has to begin while you are online, and the server replays it: the moves must be legal, the result right and the move times like those of a person. You can gain at most 120 points a day in each time control, and at most 25 rated bot games count a day. Unusual results hold a player off the board until the owner checks. The server cannot see who was at the phone, so treat this as a friendly board. A place on the board needs {0} games.": "对战机器人的等级分从 1000 起，来自你手机上与 Sibyl 和机器人的对局：正常国际象棋、有计时、以将死或和棋结束、每方至少六步，且不使用悔棋、提示和教学模式。3 分钟以内算超快棋，10 分钟以内算快棋，更长算慢棋。对局必须在联网时开始，服务器会重放它：走法必须合法、结果正确、每步用时要像真人。每种用时规则每天最多涨 120 分，每天最多计入 25 盘机器人排位赛。异常结果会让玩家暂时不上榜，直到所有者检查。服务器看不到谁在操作手机，所以请把它当作一个友好的榜单。上榜需要 {0} 盘。",
